# 2026-08-20: bump to openwrt-25.12 HEAD + MTK main HEAD. The MTK commit
# carries [CRITICAL] mt76: mt7996: Fix spinlock usage to prevent AP panic.
# Kernel moves 6.12.94 -> 6.12.103. NOT hardware verified yet.
#
# The two commits MUST move together: MTK feed patches are rebased per
# kernel, and 6.12.103 renamed mtk_eth_soc.h "int irq[3]" to
# "int irq[MTK_FE_IRQ_NUM]" - the context of the passive-mux hunk. A new
# feed on an old kernel (or the reverse) fails to patch after ~1h of build.
